# A group is disposable by default: its working graph, its account and its versions
# are none of the project's business unless that group is published.
#
# Publishing is naming it here once. Inside a published group its own .gitignore
# decides what belongs to the history (the sign, the published graph.json, the
# version snapshots) and what stays out (the live state, the account).
#
/ideas/*
!/ideas/mosshell-stage3-todos/
